\frametitle{Haskell Implementation: Simulation Step}
The simulation state is updated atomically using the State Monad.
		
		\begin{lstlisting}
			type Sim a = State SystemState a
			
			updateHypha :: Price
			-> [MushroomBody]
			-> HyphalTip
			-> Sim (Maybe HyphalTip, TaxMap)
			updateHypha currentPrice mushrooms agent = do
			let (agentAfterTax, taxes) = applyDrain agent mushrooms currentPrice
			let psi = calculatePressure currentPrice agentAfterTax
			
			if psi < dieThresh
			then return (Nothing, taxes) -- Agent Death
			else do
			-- ... Logic for Trade or Move ...
			return (Just finalAgent, taxes)
		\end{lstlisting}
